      "Nome do Estudo": "FUTURE OF FINLAND’S PARTNERSHIP WITH NATO: Creating normative scenarios with big data",
      "Link": "https://drive.google.com/u/0/open?usp=forms_web&id=17pTI6PZLcBTjujp0HdiWSyCH0OOeosv7",
      "Trata de def/seg": "Sim",
