      "Nome do Estudo": "The Illusion of Germany’s Zeitenwende",
      "Link": "https://drive.google.com/u/0/open?usp=forms_web&id=1iFOZ8UejIOBi3B_5ehbNKKGp0zsU9UCN",
      "Trata de def/seg": "Sim",
